# bug 43: recon-audit.cjs is a gate (gates.json: `recon`), so the recon-*.cjs rule above must
# not swallow it. babel-gate.cjs and runtime-gate.cjs are gates too (`babel`, `runtime`); they
# were listed as ignored above AND un-ignored here, which cancelled out to nothing and told any
# fresh clone they were generated scratch. Both pairs of lines are gone; nothing else matches
# them, so all three files stay tracked exactly as before.
!recon-audit.cjs
